      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Bike Transportation Sagri Azamgarh</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Transporting a two-wheeler from Sagri in Azamgarh to any destination requires meticulous preparation to ensure legal compliance and vehicle safety. The foundation of this process lies in presenting accurate and verifiable documentation.</p>
<p>Without the correct paperwork, your bike may be detained at checkpoints or denied boarding, causing significant delays and unnecessary stress. Therefore, understanding the essential documents is the first critical step toward a smooth logistics experience.</p>

<p>The most fundamental document is the <strong>self-attested photocopy of the Registration Certificate (RC)</strong>. This proves legal ownership and validity of the vehicle in the state of Uttar Pradesh. Ensure that the self-attestation is done clearly by signing the photocopy, as this serves as a temporary proof of the original document during transit.</p>
<p>Alongside the RC, you must provide a <strong>current Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate</strong>. The validity period is strictly enforced, so verify that the sticker and certificate are not expired. An expired PUC can lead to immediate rejection by transport partners and potential fines from traffic authorities upon arrival.</p>

<p>Equally important is a <strong>valid insurance certificate</strong>. While basic third-party insurance is legally mandatory, it often does not cover accidental damage during transit. This is where specialized coverage becomes vital. You must also secure an <strong>IBA-approved consignment bilty</strong>.</p>
<p>This document acts as the official receipt and contract between you and the logistics provider. It details the route, pickup and delivery dates, and, most importantly, the declared value of the bike. Ensure that the bilty is signed by both parties and that the vehicle’s condition is noted accurately to avoid disputes later.</p>

<p>To fully protect your investment, we strongly highlight the necessity of <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>. Standard insurance policies often have caps on coverage or exclude transit-related damages. Marine transit insurance, however, is specifically designed to cover risks associated with road transport, including accidents, theft, fire, and natural calamities.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">By opting for 100% declared-value coverage, you ensure that if any damage occurs to your bike during the journey from Sagri, you are reimbursed for the full market value of the vehicle, minus any minimal deductible.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This eliminates financial anxiety and guarantees that you will not bear the cost of repairs or total loss due to transit mishaps.</span></li></ul>

